# Generic non-polarized capacitor view: two plates across the pin axis, the pin stubs meeting their outer edges.
# Shared by several components (0402 / 0603 / 1210 etc.).
# Pin connection points, pin tails, and the body frame sit on the 0.5 mm placement lattice (ADR-0057).
